    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757330/extras/e895d4277fd931fcde3312e99ec07027.avif?t=1674748089\" /></div><br>qop 2 is a minimalistic puzzle which goal is to get the cube to finish using 4 directions in space. The difficulty increases due to the unique cubes - angular, teleports and lock cubes. <br><br>- FullHD <br>- 60 levels<br>- Smooth animation <br>- Pleasant music <br>- Intuitive interface <br>- Night mode<br>- Steam achievements <br><br>Controls: WASD, Arrows, gamepad Xbox 360 and Steam Controller<br>Restart level: R on keyboard, X on controller<br><br>&quot;qop&quot; powered by Clickteam Fusion 2.5<br>Color scheme borrowed from the beautiful game HOOK<br>Music by Delone",
